#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:27
msgid "`quantize.decTest`, `rescale.decTest`, `samequantum.decTest`, `reduce.decTest`, `trim.decTest`; `library/src/decimal_gda/quantize_zero_clamp_issue419_wbtest.mbt` (a zero result above `e_max - precision + 1` under `clamp` is folded down with Clamped)"
msgstr "`quantize.decTest`、`rescale.decTest`、`samequantum.decTest`、`reduce.decTest`、`trim.decTest`、`library/src/decimal_gda/quantize_zero_clamp_issue419_wbtest.mbt`（`clamp` のもとで `e_max - precision + 1` を超える零の結果は折り畳まれて Clamped が立つ）"

