msgstr "構成と結果"

#: manual/performance/bench/external.md:116
msgid "The floating side is measured in two configurations of the native build, each published as its own summary and shown in its own section: `native`, with the native limb primitives where the build has them, and `portable`, with the portable path forced. The target has to be reached by the portable path too. The configuration is chosen when the run starts (`--configuration NAME`, `--moon-env KEY=VALUE`) and recorded in the summary. The tables of a configuration are generated by `just bench external publish` between the marker comments below and copied without editing."
msgstr "`floating` 側は、ネイティブビルドの 2 つの構成で測定され、それぞれ独自の要約として公開され、独自の節に示されます。`native` はビルドに備わっている場合にネイティブの limb プリミティブを使い、`portable` は移植可能な経路を強制します。目標は移植可能な経路でも達成する必要があります。構成は実行の開始時に選ばれ（`--configuration NAME`、`--moon-env KEY=VALUE`）、要約に記録されます。構成ごとの表は `just bench external publish` が下のマーカーコメントの間に生成し、そのままコピーされます。"

