#: manual/verification.md:661
msgid "IEEE 754-2019 and IEEE 1788-2015 leave these points to the implementation, and IEEE 754 asks for them to be documented. Each entry names the clause that leaves it open and the choice made. The clause tables of the [binary](./conformance/bin_float.md#clause-traceability), [IEEE decimal](./conformance/decimal.md#clause-traceability), [GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md#clause-traceability) and [interval](./conformance/ball_float.md#clause-traceability) conformance pages cite them."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019 と IEEE 1788-2015 は、次の点を実装に委ねており、IEEE 754 はそれを文書化するよう求めています。各項目に、選択の余地を残す条項と採用した選択を書きます。 [binary](./conformance/bin_float.md#clause-traceability), [IEEE decimal](./conformance/decimal.md#clause-traceability), [GDA](./conformance/decimal_gda.md#clause-traceability)、[interval](./conformance/ball_float.md#clause-traceability) 適合性ページの条項表がこれらを引用します。"

