#: manual/verification.md:672
msgid "IEEE 754 §7.5"
msgstr "IEEE 754 §7.5"

#: manual/verification.md:672
msgid "Tininess detection for binary formats"
msgstr "二進形式の tininess 検出"

#: manual/verification.md:672
msgid "`BinaryContext` defaults to after rounding; before rounding is selectable and the TestFloat gate runs both. For decimal the standard requires before rounding and `DecimalContext` defaults to it; after rounding is an explicit non-standard option."
msgstr "`BinaryContext` の既定は丸め後の検出です。丸め前も選択でき、TestFloat ゲートは両方を実行します。十進では規格が丸め前を要求し、`DecimalContext` の既定もそうです。丸め後は明示的な非標準オプションです。"

#: manual/verification.md:673
msgid "IEEE 754 §6.2"
msgstr "IEEE 754 §6.2"

#: manual/verification.md:673
msgid "Which NaN payload a NaN result carries"
msgstr "NaN の結果がどの NaN ペイロードを持つか"

#: manual/verification.md:673
msgid "`bin_float`: the payload and sign of the selected NaN operand are kept and a signaling NaN is quieted. `decimal`: the first NaN operand's sign and payload, cut to its low `p` digits (`p - 1` with `clamp`, the width of the interchange payload field)."
msgstr "`bin_float`：選ばれた NaN オペランドのペイロードと符号を保ち、signaling NaN は quiet にします。`decimal`：最初の NaN オペランドの符号とペイロードを、下位 `p` 桁（`clamp` では交換形式のペイロード欄の幅である `p - 1` 桁）に切り詰めます。"

#: manual/verification.md:674
msgid "IEEE 754 §9.7"
msgstr "IEEE 754 §9.7"

#: manual/verification.md:674
msgid "Admissible payloads of `setPayload`"
msgstr "`setPayload` が受け付けるペイロード"

#: manual/verification.md:674
msgid "`decimal`: non-negative integers of at most `precision - 1` digits of the receiver; anything else gives `+0`. `bin_float` has no setPayload."
msgstr "`decimal`：レシーバーの `precision - 1` 桁以下の非負整数。それ以外は `+0` になります。`bin_float` に setPayload はありません。"

#: manual/verification.md:675
msgid "IEEE 754 §3.7"
msgstr "IEEE 754 §3.7"

#: manual/verification.md:675
msgid "Exponent range and precision of an extendable format"
msgstr "拡張可能な形式の指数範囲と精度"

#: manual/verification.md:675
msgid "`bin_float`: leading-bit exponents in `[2 - 2^30, 2^30 - 1]` (`e_min = 1 - e_max`), precision at most `2^28` bits. `decimal`: `e_min` and `e_max` within ±999,999,999, precision within `1..999,999,999`."
msgstr "`bin_float`：先頭ビットの指数は `[2 - 2^30, 2^30 - 1]`（`e_min = 1 - e_max`）、精度は最大 `2^28` ビット。`decimal`：`e_min` と `e_max` は ±999,999,999 以内、精度は `1..999,999,999`。"

