#: manual/verification.md:684
msgid "Accuracy of the elementary functions"
msgstr "初等関数の精度"

#: manual/verification.md:684
msgid "Documented per operation in the [interval accuracy table](./conformance/ball_float.md#accuracy-of-operations): basic arithmetic, `abs`, `minimum`, `maximum` and `pown` are tightest; certified trigonometric, arctangent and power endpoints are tightest; the other elementary functions are valid and were tightest on every ITF1788 case. When range reduction cannot be certified, `sin` and `cos` return `[-1, 1]` and `tan` returns Entire."
msgstr "[区間の精度表](./conformance/ball_float.md#accuracy-of-operations)で演算ごとに文書化しています。基本算術、`abs`、`minimum`、`maximum`、`pown` は最緊です。認証された三角関数、逆正接、べき乗の端点は最緊です。その他の初等関数は有効で、ITF1788 のすべてのケースで最緊でした。引数還元を認証できないとき、`sin` と `cos` は `[-1, 1]`、`tan` は Entire を返します。"

